" "http://localhost:25729/guardrails/usage/overview?start_date=2026-08-11&end_date=2026-08-18" -H "Authorization: Bearer sk-1234"` 2. `{"rows":[],"chart":[],"totalRequests":0,"totalBlocked":0,"passRate":100.0,"totalUsageUnits":{}}` then `HTTP 200` ### After (eb3ed6cf39) #### Oversized window on /guardrails/usage/overview 1. `curl -s -w "
