" "http://localhost:21861/guardrails/usage/overview?start_date=2020-01-01&end_date=2026-08-18" -H "Authorization: Bearer sk-1234"` 2. `{"detail":"Date range too large; maximum is 366 days"}` then `HTTP 400` #### Malformed start_date 1. `curl -s -w "
