HTTP %{http_code}
" "http://localhost:21861/guardrails/usage/overview?start_date=2026-08-18&end_date=2026-08-11" -H "Authorization: Bearer sk-1234"` 2. `{"detail":"start_date must be on or before end_date"}` then `HTTP 400` #### Reversed dates on /guardrails/usage/detail/{id} 1. `curl -s -w "
HTTP %{http_code}
" "http://localhost:21861/guardrails/usage/detail/e0e5cf44-3f7f-44d2-9431-3a8b442a473d?start_date=2026-08-18&end_date=2026-08-11" -H "Authorization: Bearer sk-1234"` 2. `{"detail":"start_date must be on or before end_date"}` then `HTTP 400`: the window is validated before any lookup #### Oversized window on /policies/usage/overview 1. `curl -s -w "
